21, both ''[[The Hollywood Reporter]]'' and ''[[Deadline Hollywood]]'' stated the budget to be $200 million.<ref name="Averted">{{cite web|url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/heat-vision/warner-bros-legendary-nearing-deal-to-resolve-clash-over-godzilla-vs-kong-exclusive|title=Warner Bros., Legendary Nearing Deal to Resolve Clash Over 'Godzilla vs. Kong' (Exclusive)|first1=Kim
